{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52003","headline":"春日山庄言志 · 王绩","name":"春日山庄言志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平子试归田，风光溢眼前。\n野楼全跨迥，山阁半临烟。\n入屋敧生树，当堦逆涌泉。\n翦茅通磵底，移柳向河边。\n崩砂犹有处，卧石不知年。\n入谷开斜道，横溪渡小船。\n郑玄唯解义，王烈镇寻仙。\n去去人间远，谁知心自然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}